  "contentHtml": "<p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">지구의 날을 맞아 생물의 다양성 보존을 위한 캠페인 활동의 일환으로</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">멸종위기생물을 위한 SAVE ME 카드 만들기 활동을 2차시에 걸쳐 실시했습니다.</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&lt;1차시&gt;&#160;</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">1. 챗 GPT 를 이용하여 멸종 위기 생물 26종 검색</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">※ 검색에 오류가 있는지 멸종 위기종이 아닌 생물도 포함이...ㅠㅠ</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/191acc7a2c5e4ac8a6f67681b250c8c53cd78350\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/191acc7a2c5e4ac8a6f67681b250c8c53cd78350\" data-origin-width=\"520\" data-origin-height=\"484\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #333333; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">2. 작품 예시 설명</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fd49c7d4b3fca31a01b4b04856a91b444f6840f0\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fd49c7d4b3fca31a01b4b04856a91b444f6840f0\" data-origin-width=\"860\" data-origin-height=\"489\"></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Sans KR';\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">※ 반드시 포함되어야 할 항목</span></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Sans KR';\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;가. 생물 이미지(그림) : 직접 그림으로써 생물종의 특징을 이해할 수 있음 (그림 실력이 부족한 학생은 여전히 AR드로잉 활용)</span></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Sans KR';\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;나. 생물의 분류 : 계문강목과속종 분류에 맞춰 해당 생물이 어떤 분류체계에 해당하는지 확인</span></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Sans KR';\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;다. 생물의 외침 : 멸종 위기에 처한 생물에 대한 공감</span></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Sans KR';\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;라. 위협 요인, 우리가 할 일 : 멸종 위기 종을 SAVE 하기 위한 고민</span></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">3. 자신의 학번에 해당하는 생물에 대한 정보 탐색 - 스마트폰 제공</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">4. B4 용지와 네임펜 제공</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&lt;2차시&gt;&#160;</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">1차시에 이어서 카드 작성 마무리</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&lt;우수작&gt;</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">복도게시판에 게시한 후 당선작은 간식으로 보상</span></p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9f3be3fd43a28ff4fd10e5e6dde06f366061e576\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9f3be3fd43a28ff4fd10e5e6dde06f366061e576\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"4032\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6a255c6e1513b5db64f681c090ccd05909749d55\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6a255c6e1513b5db64f681c090ccd05909749d55\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"4032\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b0b858686271224dd438eab72488411330a629c2\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b0b858686271224dd438eab72488411330a629c2\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"4032\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/49449bac819d9fd5f09eff209058bd2eeb92eb3b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/49449bac819d9fd5f09eff209058bd2eeb92eb3b\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"4032\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f319ab9f4d63fe234d89588ebf86db05dd09b8b0\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f319ab9f4d63fe234d89588ebf86db05dd09b8b0\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"4032\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7f0aaec910661089ab25dfe2fdb1cd5983658434\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7f0aaec910661089ab25dfe2fdb1cd5983658434\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/01662aa04cac8de81350bf0927fbd3f3a2d74f6d?download\" data-file-name=\"멸종위기종의 외침, SAVE ME 카드 만들기.hwpx\" data-file-size=\"20035\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwpx\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHu%26dataid%3D19%26fileid%3D9%26regdt%3D20250508143547&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F01662aa04cac8de81350bf0927fbd3f3a2d74f6d')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">멸종위기종의 외침, SAVE ME 카드 만들기</span><span class=\"type\">.hwpx</span></div><div class=\"size\">19.57KB</div></div></a></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
